Ported changes so far: redirect of / to /dashboard (commit 39f5307); GHCR release workflow,
adapted (commits 4419eae, 3b38755, 93d60e1); Fleet vehicle command registry with request
body validation before queuing, adapted (commits 94d1fd8, dc233a6); skipping of queued
commands whose HTTP client stopped waiting, adapted (commits 64390c6, 40cb54b, 82c4113,
980553e); body controller state read through the BLE queue (VCSEC domain), adapted
(commit 94d1fd8); climate setpoint commands set_temps and set_preconditioning_max, adapted
(commit 94d1fd8); climate keeper, cabin overheat protection and bioweapon defense
commands set_climate_keeper_mode, set_cabin_overheat_protection, set_cop_temp and
set_bioweapon_mode, adapted (commit 94d1fd8); seat heater, seat cooler, auto seat climate and
steering wheel heater commands remote_seat_heater_request, remote_seat_cooler_request,
remote_auto_seat_climate_request and remote_steering_wheel_heater_request, adapted
(commit 94d1fd8); trunk and window commands actuate_trunk and window_control, adapted
(commit 94d1fd8); charge schedule commands add_charge_schedule and set_scheduled_charging,
adapted (commits 8bf65b8, c68b8ee); max range and standard charging, software update, volume
and media playback commands charge_max_range, charge_standard, schedule_software_update,
cancel_software_update, adjust_volume and media_toggle_playback, adapted (commit 94d1fd8);
BLE connection status route connection_status, adapted (commits 6ca3e0e, b971a05); choice of
the Bluetooth adapter with btAdapter, adapted (commit feadd14). Each ported change references
the original Lenart12 commit in its commit message.

Changes made in this fork are recorded in the git history of this repository.
